  "narration": {
    "voice": "en-US-AvaNeural",
    "alignment": "Edge TTS native word boundaries verified against Whisper tiny.en waveform alignment",
    "phrases": [
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "What if you saved the person you loved, only to be abandoned by them?",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 4.58
      },
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "In Greek myth, Ariadne, daughter of King Minos of Crete, sees the Athenian prince Theseus among young people heading toward the Labyrinth.",
        "start": 5.06,
        "end": 15.8
      },
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "He plans to confront the Minotaur.",
        "start": 18.96,
        "end": 20.74
      },
      {
        "scene": "S01",
        "text": "Few expect him to emerge.",
        "start": 20.28,
        "end": 20.74
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "Ariadne gives Theseus a sword and a spool of thread.",
        "start": 21.7,
        "end": 25.34
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "She tells him to fasten one end at the entrance, and unwind the rest as he walks.",
        "start": 25.34,
        "end": 31.92
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "He can fight the monster if he chooses.",
        "start": 32.66,
        "end": 34.56
      },
      {
        "scene": "S02",
        "text": "But the thread is his only sure way through the maze.",
        "start": 35.16,
        "end": 38.38
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "Theseus follows the thread through winding corridors until he meets the Minotaur.",
        "start": 39.54,
        "end": 44.32
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "The struggle is brutal.",
        "start": 45.04,
        "end": 46.48
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "At last, Theseus defeats the creature.",
        "start": 47.14,
        "end": 50.08
      },
      {
        "scene": "S03",
        "text": "He follows Ariadnes thread back toward daylight, while the people waiting outside listen for footsteps.",
        "start": 50.08,
        "end": 57.44
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "Ariadne leaves her father and her home to flee with Theseus.",
        "start": 58.7,
        "end": 62.94
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "Their ship cuts through the Aegean.",
        "start": 63.5,
        "end": 65.5
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "She has risked everything for him.",
        "start": 66.16,
        "end": 68.62
      },
      {
        "scene": "S04",
        "text": "At night on deck, the island of Crete disappears behind them, and she finally lets herself believe they have a future.",
        "start": 68.84,
        "end": 77.12
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "The ship stops at Naxos.",
        "start": 77.969,
        "end": 80.24
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "In a well-known version of the myth, Ariadne is left asleep on the shore while Theseus sails away.",
        "start": 80.74,
        "end": 88.12
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "She wakes to the sound of waves.",
        "start": 88.8,
        "end": 90.66
      },
      {
        "scene": "S05",
        "text": "She searches the beach, sees a distant sail, and realizes she has been abandoned.",
        "start": 91.36,
        "end": 97.24
      },
      {
        "scene": "S06",
        "text": "Other ancient tellings give Ariadne a different fate.",
        "start": 98.58,
        "end": 101.82
      },
      {
        "scene": "S06",
        "text": "But the abandoned Ariadne remains a painful image: the woman whose courage brought a hero home was left without a home herself.",
        "start": 102.18,
        "end": 111.4
      },
      {
        "scene": "S06",
        "text": "On the sand, she holds the end of a red thread with no one on the other side.",
        "start": 111.98,
        "end": 117.58
      }
    ],
